UPDATE `courses` SET `apply_form` = 'https://programsandcourses.anu.edu.au/2026/program/8603XMPHIL', `course_description` = '<h4>Course Information</h4> <p>The Australian National University provides MPhil candidates with a vibrant research community and outstanding program support. When selecting a research program, an institutions reputation is everything. ANU is one of the worlds leading universities, and the smart choice for your research program. As an MPhil candidate you will work with increased independence, under the direction of a supervisory panel of experts in the field. Your research will make an original and important contribution to human knowledge, research and development.</p> <h5>Course Structure</h5> <p>Completion of a standard program for a Master of Philosophy requires a minimum of 48 units and a maximum of 96 units of enrolment in the research component</p>', `enrolment_fee` = 150.0, `total_course_duration` = '2 years full-time (104 weeks)', `assessment_style` = 'assignment', `intakes` = 'First Semester', `updated_at` = '2026-11-02 16:20:46' WHERE `id` = 1594;
UPDATE `courses` SET `apply_form` = 'https://programsandcourses.anu.edu.au/2026/program/9603XPHD', `course_description` = '<h4>Course Information</h4> <p>The Australian National University provides PhD candidates with a vibrant research community and outstanding program support. When selecting a research program, an institutions reputation is everything. ANU is one of the worlds leading universities, and the smart choice for your research program. As a PhD candidate you will work with increased independence, under the direction of a supervisory panel of experts in the field. Your research will make an original and important contribution to human knowledge, research and development.</p> <h5>Course Structure</h5> <p>The Doctor of Philosophy requires completion of a research project that demonstrates a significant and original contribution to knowledge in the field of study. This includes the submission and successful examination of a thesis of up to 100,000 words.</p>', `enrolment_fee` = 150.0, `total_course_duration` = '4 years full-time (208 weeks)', `assessment_style` = 'mixed', `intakes` = 'First Semester', `updated_at` = '2026-11-02 16:20:46' WHERE `id` = 1595;
UPDATE `courses` SET `apply_form` = 'https://programsandcourses.anu.edu.au/2026/program/8601XMPHIL', `course_description` = '<h4>Course Information</h4> <p>The Australian National University provides our Master of Philosophy students with a vibrant research community and outstanding program support. When selecting a research program, an institutions reputation is everything. ANU is one of the worlds leading universities, and the smart choice for your research program.</p> <h5>Course Structure</h5> <p>96 Units</p>', `entry_requirements` = '<h4>Academic Entry Requirements (International Students)</h4><ul><li>Applicants must:; 1. Present a relevant Bachelor degree or international equivalent; With a minimum overall grade of distinction or higher; or an equivalent combination of qualifications, research publications and/or professional experience related to the field of study.; 2. Have the written approval of an identified supervisor for the research project/thesis.; 3. Provide:; A detailed research proposal outlining your intended research, (applicants should seek guidance from the potential supervisor regarding length and content); Original evidence of all relevant academic qualifications and graduation documentation (with English translation as appropriate); An up to date CV including academic qualifications, work experience and research publications; At least two academic referee reports.</li></ul>', `enrolment_fee` = 150.0, `total_course_duration` = '2 years full-time (104 weeks)', `assessment_style` = 'assignment', `intakes` = 'First Semester', `updated_at` = '2026-11-02 16:20:46' WHERE `id` = 1596;
UPDATE `courses` SET `apply_form` = 'https://programsandcourses.anu.edu.au/2026/program/9602XPHD', `course_description` = '<h4>Course Information</h4> <p>The Australian National University provides PhD students with a vibrant research community and outstanding program support. When selecting a research program, an institutions reputation is everything. ANU is one of the worlds leading universities, and the smart choice for your research program. As a PhD student you will work with increased independence, under the direction of a supervisory panel of experts in the field. Your research will make an original and important contribution to human knowledge, research and development.</p> <h5>Course Structure</h5> <p>The Doctor of Philosophy requires the submission and successful examination of a thesis of up to 100,000 words.</p>', `enrolment_fee` = 150.0, `total_course_duration` = '4 years full-time (208 weeks)', `assessment_style` = 'mixed', `intakes` = 'First Semester', `updated_at` = '2026-11-02 16:20:46' WHERE `id` = 1597;
UPDATE `courses` SET `apply_form` = 'https://programsandcourses.anu.edu.au/2026/program/MEMPP', `course_description` = '<h4>Course Information</h4> <p>This degree offers senior managers engaged in public policy within or outside government the opportunity to build skills and knowledge for governing and leading ethically in a global world. It is designed to strengthen and stretch you capacity to be an executive leader working in complex and dynamic policy environments. Throughout the EMPP degree you will reflect on your extensive policy experience, drawing on relevant scholarly debates on leadership and strategic policy making in contemporary governance. The degree strengthens your capacity for effective executive leadership in public policy particularly in analytic, strategic and reflective thinking. You will be equipped with cutting edge conceptual and analytical tools, as well as skills in policy communication and persuasion. The one year Executive Masters degree offers a unique cohort experience in high quality education at Australias leading public policy school. Designed and taught by world class public policy scholars from the ANUs Crawford School, this Masters degree is delivered through a mix of case based, interactive and intensive modes of teaching.</p> <h5>Course Structure</h5> <p>The Executive Master of Public Policy requires the completion of 48 units</p>', `entry_requirements` = '<h4>Academic Entry Requirements (International Students)</h4><ul><li>A Bachelor degree or international equivalent with a minimum GPA of 5.0/7.0.</li></ul>', `enrolment_fee` = 150.0, `total_course_duration` = '1 year full-time (52 weeks)', `assessment_style` = 'assignment', `intakes` = 'First Semester', `updated_at` = '2026-11-02 16:20:46' WHERE `id` = 1598;
UPDATE `courses` SET `entry_requirements` = '<h4>Academic Entry Requirements (International Students)</h4><ul><li>Australian Year 12 inside or outside of Australia</li></ul>', `enrolment_fee` = 150.0, `total_course_duration` = '104 weeks', `assessment_style` = 'assignment', `intakes` = 'First Semester', `updated_at` = '2026-11-02 16:20:46' WHERE `id` = 1599;
