UPDATE `courses` SET `apply_form` = 'https://spi.nsw.edu.au/master-of-business-administration-technology-leadership/', `course_description` = '<h4>Course Information</h4> <p>The MBA is a course designed for students with an undergraduate degree wishing to enter or advance in the digital workforce in the areas of technology leadership, digital marketing, or digital transformation. It also appeals to students with an existing postgraduate degree wishing to change career direction or to enhance skills within their current industry as it transforms to digital business. It can also supplement prior study in the areas of technology, data, information systems, business, or other fields, where the student needs to develop and hone skills in the areas of business and management in a digitised context. Technology Leadership - this specialisation focuses on developing skills and knowledge in leading organisations to technical excellence, leading technology startups, and growing agile organisations based on technology utilisation. It also provides opportunities for the management of technology teams in localised and globalised forms, and the creation of a technology-based competitive advantage for the organisation. Additionally, it explores how technology can be used to drive sustainable practices and address environmental and social challenges.</p> <h5>Course Structure</h5> <p>120 Credit Points</p>', `total_course_duration` = '2 years full-time (104 weeks)', `intakes` = '12-Aug-24 / 20-Sep-24', `updated_at` = '2026-11-02 16:20:46' WHERE `id` = 6150;
